Installation Steps for Priori AI (Mac)

Unzip the downloaded file

Double-click the downloaded zip file
A folder named "priori-ai-users" will be created


Open Terminal

Open Terminal from Applications → Utilities → Terminal
Navigate to the extracted folder:
cd path/to/priori-ai-users



Install dependencies

Using pnpm (recommended):
pnpm install

Or using npm:
npm install

Start the application

Using pnpm:
pnpm dev

Or using npm:
npm run dev



Set up EHR connection

Within the application, select your EHR system (Epic or Cerner)
Enter connection credentials when prompted
Follow on-screen instructions to complete setup


Try your first authorization

Select a patient record
Choose a procedure requiring authorization
Let Priori AI guide you through the optimized authorization process


